{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35834","headline":"题陈正字林亭 · 李咸用","name":"题陈正字林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓烟轻翠拂帘飞，黄叶飘零弄所思。\n正是低摧吾道日，不堪惆怅异乡时。\n家林蛇豕方羣起，宫沼龟龙未有期。\n赖有平原怜贱子，满亭山色借吟诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}